12: Character 凛
13:   Property display = "凛"
14:   Property voice = "/Game/Ring/VO/Rin"
16: Character 玩家 player
18: Character 店主
19:   Property display = "街角店主"
23: Fact 换水次数: int = 0
24: Fact 梅蕾状态: tag in (含苞, 初绽, 盛开, 枯萎) = 含苞
25: Fact 周期: int extern
26: Fact 色温: float extern session
28: FactGroup 墨梅册
29:   Fact 第一页: bool
30:   Fact 第二页: bool
31:   Fact 第三页: bool
33: FactGroup 显影点 extern
34:   Fact 阳台: bool
35:   Fact 门缝: bool
36:   Fact 信箱: bool
38: FactGroup 门禁 extern
39:   Fact 权限等级: int range 0..3
40:   Fact 谜题已解: bool
42: Fact 店主提到过梅: bool
43: Fact 凛提到过等待: bool
47: Chapter 序章
48:   Property title = "公寓"
50: Chapter 第一章 after 序章
51:   Property title = "一条街"
52:   Implied
53:     Implication 换水次数 = 1
54:     Implication 梅蕾状态 = 初绽
55:     Implication 墨梅册.第一页 = true
56:   Advance -> 终局_花开 if ((梅蕾状态 == 盛开) and 墨梅册.第三页)
57:   Advance -> 终局_永闭 if ((周期 >= 47) and (梅蕾状态 != 盛开))
59: Chapter 终局_花开 after 第一章
60:   Property title = "花开"
61:   Implied
62:     Implication 梅蕾状态 = 盛开
63:     Implication 墨梅册.第三页 = true
65: Chapter 终局_永闭 after 第一章
66:   Property title = "永闭"
67:   Implied
68:     Implication 周期 = 47
74: Quest 记忆链_第二页
75:   Property priority = "hidden"
76:   Objective 显影点.阳台
77:   Objective 店主提到过梅
78:   Objective 凛提到过等待
79:   On complete
80:     Command set 墨梅册.第二页 = true
81:     Command play 记忆插帧_01
83: Quest 记忆链_第三页
84:   Property priority = "hidden"
85:   Available 墨梅册.第二页
86:   Objective 显影点.门缝
87:   Objective 显影点.信箱
88:   Objective 门禁.谜题已解
89:   On complete
90:     Command set 墨梅册.第三页 = true
95: Dialogue 凛_第一次换水 for 凛 if (换水次数 == 0)
96:   Speech 凛(轻声) "水该换了。"
97:   Speech 玩家 "我来。"
98:   Command play 换水
99:   Command set 换水次数 += 1
100:   Command set 梅蕾状态 = 初绽
101:   Speech 凛 "第一滴。" @镜头微推
102:   Command advance 第一章
104: Dialogue 凛_换水 for 凛 if ((换水次数 > 0) and ((周期 % 3) == 0))
105:   Speech 凛 "今天也换吧。"
106:   Command play 换水
107:   Command set 换水次数 += 1
108:   If ((换水次数 >= 5) and (梅蕾状态 == 初绽))
109:     Command set 梅蕾状态 = 盛开
110:     Speech 凛(笑) "开了。"
112: Dialogue 凛_日常 for 凛
113:   If (周期 >= 40)
114:     Speech 凛(低头) "快到了。"
115:     Narration "她没有说是什么快到了。"
116:   ElseIf (visited(凛_日常) == 0)
117:     Speech 凛 "你回来了。"
118:   Else
119:     Speech 凛 "嗯。"
120:   Choice "你在等什么?" once
121:     Speech 凛(沉默) "……"
122:     Command set 凛提到过等待 = true
123:     Command play 记忆插帧_01
124:   Choice "没事。"
125:   Speech 凛 "早点睡。" if=(周期 >= 30)
126:   Jump end
130: Dialogue 店主_梅 for 店主 if (梅蕾状态 == 盛开)
131:   Speech 店主 "开了?那株梅。"
132:   Command set 店主提到过梅 = true
134: Dialogue 店主_枯 for 店主 if (梅蕾状态 == 枯萎)
135:   Speech 店主(叹气) "可惜。"
137: Dialogue 店主_闲聊 for 店主
138:   Speech 店主 "又来了。"
139:   Choice "打听那株梅" if=(not 店主提到过梅) once
140:     Speech 店主 "你屋里那株?以前也有人这么养过。"
141:       Continuation "养到第四十七天,人走了。"
142:     Command set 店主提到过梅 = true
143:   Choice "打听门禁" if=(门禁.权限等级 < 3)
144:     Speech 店主 "楼下那扇门,钥匙不在锁上。"
145:     Narration "他没有再说下去。"
146:   Choice "走了。"
151: Stage 换水
152:   Duration 8s
153:   Track anim
154:     StageEntry 0s montage AM_换水
155:   Track camera
156:     StageEntry 0s blend from game 0.3s
157:     StageEntry 0.5s push 8 cm over 6s
158:   Track game
159:     StageEntry 0s..8s input lock
160:   Restore
161:     RestoreEntry camera blend back 0.3s
163: Stage 镜头微推
164:   Property base = "line"
165:   Track camera
166:     StageEntry 0% push 4 cm over 100%
168: Stage 记忆插帧_01
169:   Duration 0.6s
170:   Track mask
171:     StageEntry 0s..0.6s cut black
172:   Track ui
173:     StageEntry 0.1s text "梅" style 浮字
174:   Restore
175:     RestoreEntry ui clear
177: Stage 死亡黑屏
178:   Duration 4s
179:   Track mask
180:     StageEntry 0s..4s fade black 0.4s
181:   Track ui
182:     StageEntry 1s text "她还想继续等" style 浮字
183:   Track game
184:     StageEntry 0s..4s input lock
185:   Restore
186:     RestoreEntry ui clear
187:     RestoreEntry camera blend back 0.5s
